						<p class="section-subheading a-up a-delay-1"			>
				Welcome to					</p>
						
 
 
						<h1 class="section-heading a-up"			>
				Mollie Aspen					</h1>
						
 
 
						<div class="section-copy a-up a-delay-2"			>
				<h6>Awarded One <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://mollieaspen.com/awards/">MICHELIN Key</a></span> in 2026, MOLLIE is a boutique hotel inspired by the layered spirit of Aspen and the many individuals who shaped its vibrant history.</h6>
<p><span class="citation-140 citation-141 citation-end-141">A place that honors the outdoors and encourages adventure while providing a luxurious experience to its guests. It is a place that believes in the beauty and freedom of simplicity and s</span><span class="citation-140 citation-end-140">ubtlety. Come here to connect, to get inspired, to find re</span>spite.</p>
					</div>
						<div class="section-buttons a-up a-delay-3">
				



			<div 		>
				<a class="btn btn-outline" href="https://be.synxis.com/?adult=1&#038;arrive=2023-10-06&#038;chain=10237&#038;child=0&#038;currency=USD&#038;depart=2023-10-07&#038;hotel=41140&#038;level=hotel&#038;locale=en-US&#038;rooms=1" target="_blank">
			Book Your Stay					</a>
			</div>
					



			<div 		>
				<a class="link" href="https://mollieaspen.com/our-hotel/" target="_self">
			ABOUT THE HOTEL					</a>
			</div>
				</div>
		</div>
				<div class="hp-hotel__media a-up">
			<div class="hp-hotel__video bg-cover">
				
    <img width="690" height="985" src="https://mollieaspen.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/home-hotel-warion-taipei-unsplash-scaled-1-690x985.jpg" class="attachment-full-content-image size-full-content-image" alt="View of someone sitting at the MOLLIE, a boutique hotel in Aspen" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />			</div>
			
 
 
						<p class="hp-hotel__media-caption d-md-only a-up a-delay-1"			>
				Find retreat, warmth, and respite.  					</p>
					</div>
			</div>
</section>

