											</div>
						
 
 
						<div class="section-copy a-up a-delay-3"			>
				<h6>Crafting a thoughtful, warm experience for visitors and locals alike.</h6>
<p>MOLLIE Aspen offers a comprehensive range of dining options from morning to night. Indulge in delicious cuisine at <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://mollieaspen.com/restaurants-bars/petit-trois/">Petit Trois</a></span>, our lobby bar and restaurant, featuring indoor and year-round outdoor heated seating on two terraces. Our inviting cafe provides a casual dining experience for both breakfast and lunch. Relax and unwind by the hearth and savor a carefully crafted cocktail or kick start your morning with small batch coffee sourced from Sightglass.</p>
					</div>
